# Trivy ignore file. It ships empty on purpose: prefer fixing a finding over ignoring it.
#
# Entry format: one ID per line (CVE-..., GHSA-..., a misconfig ID such as AVD-DS-0002, or a
# secret rule ID), optionally followed by an expiry date, after which Trivy reports it again:
#
#   CVE-2026-12345 exp:2027-01-31
#
# Every entry must be preceded by a comment that gives:
#   - the reason it is ignored,
#   - the owner who reviews it,
#   - a link to the advisory,
#   - why it is not exploitable here.
#
# Entries are reviewed when they expire.
